@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@baseUrlDev = https://nuernbergspots.de/dev
@baseUrlPrd = https://nuernbergspots.de/prd
@firebaseApiKeyDev = YOUR_DEV_FIREBASE_API_KEY
@firebaseApiKeyPrd = YOUR_PRD_FIREBASE_API_KEY
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Get Firebase ID Token (DEV project: citylife-fe75a)
### API key from .env.dev -> FIREBASE_API_KEY
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword?key={{firebaseApiKeyDev}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "your-password",
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### Get Firebase ID Token (PRD project: nuernbergspots-b460a)
### API key from .env.prd -> FIREBASE_API_KEY
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword?key={{firebaseApiKeyPrd}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "your-password",
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### Anonymous token (DEV) - use for local/dev API testing
# @name devAnonymousToken
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key={{firebaseApiKeyDev}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### Anonymous token (PRD) - use for prod API testing
# @name prdAnonymousToken
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key={{firebaseApiKeyPrd}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### Copy idToken from response into @adminToken or @devToken/@prdToken
### Cross-env diagnostics: see requests/env-diagnostic.http

